  "contentHtml": "\n<p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317143313im_/http://imgsrv.knx1070.com/image/knx/UserFiles/Image/Tiny%20Baby.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p>Хүүхэд\n гэж гэр бүлийн гэрэл гэгээ болсон байдаг билээ. Харин энэ бяцхан \nхүүхдүүд хүндрэлтэй төрөөд амьдарч чадалгүй нас барцгаасан юм байна. Та \nбүхэн эдгээр хүүхдүүдийн нүдний харцыг хараад өрөвдөх сэтгэл төрөх байх \nгэж бодож байна. <!--break--></p><div><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317143313im_/http://english.people.com.cn/200607/07/images/xin_4907030621226473219554.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317143313im_/http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/Premature_baby_with_improvised_oxygen_mask.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317143313im_/http://english.people.com.cn/200607/07/images/xin_4907030621228511619655.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317143313im_/http://www.glahaiti.org/comingsoon/user_files/Premature%20babies/Premature%20baby%20C.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317143313im_/http://cache.daylife.com/imageserve/0aeZbGz8Bo1QD/610x.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><br><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317143313im_/http://bethanyhousegresham.files.wordpress.com/2008/03/0303081117b1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317143313im_/http://img292.imageshack.us/img292/7906/kimberlymuellerworldstiyi8.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><p>&nbsp;</p><br></div>",
